export anchor DarkBentoStyle:
    number: 231
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Dark bento
    idea: An asymmetric bento of rounded tiles in different sizes and faint tints on near-black, where size carries priority, so the greeting and the overdue count are the biggest tiles and the two troubled projects outsize the healthy ones.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #09090b, the page gaps and the style sheet
        tile: #151518, plain tiles, fields and the nav pill
        greetingTile: #1a1724, the violet tinted greeting and hours tiles
        overdueTile: #2a1517, the coral tinted overdue tile
        overdueInk: #ffb4a8, text and the huge figure on the overdue tile
        chartTile: #0f1b1c, the teal tinted chart tile
        okTile: #111a15, faint green project tiles
        riskTile: #211c10, the faint amber project tile
        badTile: #261416, the faint red project tile
        line: #2a2a30, edges of fields and the nav pill
        ink: #f4f4f5, text, figures, progress fill and the current nav pill
        muted: #a1a1aa, labels and meta
        pink: #ff8fb1, the logo, the primary button and focus
        onPink: #2e0614, text on pink
        teal: #4fd1c5, this week bars
        lastWeek: #71717a, last week bars
        ok: #86e0a5, the On track chip
        risk: #f5cb6b, the At risk chip
        bad: #ff9a8a, the Behind chip and the overdue line
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue. Base
        14px. The greeting is 52px at 850 tracked minus 0.04em, the overdue
        figure 112px at 900, the hours figure 88px, other tile figures 44px
        at 850, project percents 30px and 64px on the largest tile, project
        names 16px at 800, tile labels 13px at 700 in muted.
    layout:
        A top row holds a pink rounded B logo, a pill nav with icons and
        labels where Home is a white pill with dark text, a pill search, a
        pink pill New project, a round bell and a rounded MO tile named Mara
        Okafor. The bento is a 12 column grid with 12px gutters. The first
        two rows give six columns to the greeting tile with the date, Good
        morning, Mara. in 52px heavy type and 4 tasks are overdue in coral,
        three columns to the overdue tile with a 112px figure 4 and Clear
        these first, and three columns stacked with Active projects 6 and
        Tasks due this week 23. The third row gives nine columns to the
        teal tinted chart tile with values over the bars and the totals, and
        three to the hours tile with 186. The last row gives eight columns
        to a nested project bento of four columns. Billing migration takes a
        two by two tile, Mobile app 2.0 a wide tile, Website redesign and
        Q4 customer survey single tiles, and Spring catalogue and Onboarding
        emails wide tiles. Each project tile is tinted by status and holds a
        status chip, name, category and due, a big percent, a thick white
        track and tasks. Four columns go to What happened, the activity
        list. Below 1180px nav labels hide and tiles reflow. Below 700px the
        grid is two columns and the chart scrolls inside its tile.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 12px gutters between every tile, 22px tile padding, 32px in the greeting tile.
    density: Medium. Few words per tile and very large figures, with size showing priority.
    corners: Big. 22px tiles, 14px logo, avatar and fields, pill nav, buttons and chips.
    borders: None on tiles, which separate by tint and gutter. Only the nav pill and fields carry 1px #2a2a30.
    shadows: None. Near-black gutters do the work.
    icons:
        Bold line icons at 2px stroke, 18px. Status chips sit on a
        translucent black pill with a check circle, a triangle or a crossed
        square and the word.
    focus: A 3px pink outline offset 3px.
    tone: Punchy and direct, such as Good morning, Mara., Clear these first and What happened.
